# ── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*~

# ── Obsidian per-user UI state (the rest of .obsidian/ is tracked) ──
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache

# ── Safety snapshots (local recovery only) ─────────────────────────
**/_generator/_snapshots/
**/Presentation/build/_engine-snapshots/

# ── Generator scratch (media-map.json, spot-check PNGs) ────────────
**/Presentation/build/_generator/tmp/

# ── Large binaries ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The source .pptx is the MASTER input and is NOT reproducible. Back it up
# outside git (or move it to Git LFS). It is ignored here only to keep the
# repo lean — "ignored" does not mean "safe to lose".
10 - Courses/*/Source Deck/*.pptx
10 - Courses/*/Source Deck/*.ppt

# Extracted slide media (~160 MB) — regenerable from the .pptx via
# extract-media.ps1. Track separately or via Git LFS if it must be versioned.
10 - Courses/*/Presentation/build/assets/img/

# Source Library reference PDFs (~680 MB) — static inputs. Back up
# separately or use Git LFS.
20 - Source Library/**/*.pdf
20 - Source Library/**/*.docx
20 - Source Library/**/*.lnk

# Historic Educational Services archive — browse-only, unverified, ~140 files
# in deeply-nested folders (some exceed the Windows path limit). The catalogue
# note "Historic Educational Services Training Content.md" one level up stays
# tracked; the archive contents themselves do not need versioning.
20 - Source Library/Historic Educational Services Training Content/

# ── Stray artifact ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# invalid 20-byte file at the vault root from an aborted regen; the real
# course data is 10 - Courses/.../Presentation/course/course-data.js
/course-data.js
